{"id":"ev8-southern-spain","title":"EuroVelo 8 in southern Spain","who":"EuroVelo 8 · Mediterranean Route","when":"Best October–May","vehicle":"Bicycle, 2–3 weeks","kind":"bike","color":"#ea580c","summary":"The start of the long Mediterranean route: from Cádiz past Tarifa and Gibraltar, along the Costa del Sol, inland to Granada and the Alhambra, the desert coast of Almería, Murcia and on to Valencia. In Spain the route is still mostly unsigned and on roads, so plan your own way.","sources":[{"label":"Wikipedia: EV8 The Mediterranean Route","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EV8_The_Mediterranean_Route"}],"approximate":"The towns the EuroVelo plan passes; most of it is not yet built, so the way is approximate.","km":1129,"bbox":[-6.2929,36.0129,-0.3764,39.4698],"stops":[{"name":"Cádiz","place":"Cádiz, Spain","at":[36.5297,-6.2929],"text":"Start of EuroVelo 8.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Cadiz_aerea.jpg/500px-Cadiz_aerea.jpg","page":"Cádiz","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cadiz_aerea.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Tarifa","place":"Tarifa, Spain","at":[36.0129,-5.605],"text":"Africa across the strait; the signed section starts here."},{"name":"Algeciras","place":"Algeciras, Spain","at":[36.1312,-5.4474],"text":"Past Gibraltar to Guadiaro."},{"name":"Marbella","place":"Marbella, Spain","at":[36.5075,-4.8047],"text":"Costa del Sol.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/Captivating_Views_of_Old_Town_Marbella.jpg/500px-Captivating_Views_of_Old_Town_Marbella.jpg","page":"Marbella","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Captivating_Views_of_Old_Town_Marbella.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Málaga","place":"Málaga, Spain","at":[36.7648,-4.4422],"text":"Picasso's city.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Da_Gibralfaro_%28cropped%292.jpg/500px-Da_Gibralfaro_%28cropped%292.jpg","page":"Málaga","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Da_Gibralfaro_%28cropped%292.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Granada","place":"Granada, Spain","at":[37.1735,-3.5995],"text":"Inland to the Alhambra.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Dawn_Charles_V_Palace_Alhambra_Granada_Andalusia_Spain.jpg/500px-Dawn_Charles_V_Palace_Alhambra_Granada_Andalusia_Spain.jpg","page":"Alhambra","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dawn_Charles_V_Palace_Alhambra_Granada_Andalusia_Spain.jpg","credit":"Jebulon","license":"CC0"}},{"name":"Almería","place":"Almería, Spain","at":[36.8686,-2.312],"text":"Desert coast and Cabo de Gata.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Alcazaba_1%2C_Almeria%2C_Spain.jpg/500px-Alcazaba_1%2C_Almeria%2C_Spain.jpg","page":"Almería","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alcazaba_1%2C_Almeria%2C_Spain.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Cartagena","place":"Cartagena, Spain","at":[37.6155,-0.9875],"text":"Roman and naval port."},{"name":"Alicante","place":"Alicante, Spain","at":[38.3436,-0.4882],"text":"Costa Blanca.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Alicante%2C_Spain.jpg/500px-Alicante%2C_Spain.jpg","page":"Alicante","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alicante%2C_Spain.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Valencia","place":"Valencia, Spain","at":[39.4697,-0.3763],"text":"Paella at the end; the route goes on to Barcelona and France.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Malvarrosa_Beach%2C_Valencia%2C_Spain_%2829812271043%29.jpg/500px-Malvarrosa_Beach%2C_Valencia%2C_Spain_%2829812271043%29.jpg","page":"Valencia","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Malvarrosa_Beach%2C_Valencia%2C_Spain_%2829812271043%29.jpg","cre